  <ul>
    <li><a href="/getting-started/quick-start/">Quick start</a>: build a Chart.</li>
    <li><a href="/getting-started/core-concepts/">Core concepts</a>: Vessels, Variants, and the Chart.</li>
    <li><a href="/understanding/protocol/">The protocol</a>: Engine messages and wire envelopes.</li>
    <li><a href="/understanding/engine/">The engine</a>: planning, validation, and history.</li>
    <li><a href="/understanding/why-maelstrom/">Why Maelstrom</a>: the motivation.</li>
  </ul>
</StarlightPage>
